lazysite (0.7.18-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * EDGE: SM155 - the domain delegation binding moves from the account to the
    GROUP. A group carries dav_scope (content root) + home_domain; adding a
    member to a scoped group both grants editing and confines them to that
    domain. A member of several scoped groups gets the UNION of their content
    roots, enforced on every channel (manager UI, control API, MCP, WebDAV).
    The per-account binding is dropped (single-source); set it on the Groups
    page or `group-set <group> dav_scope <root>`.
  * SM155: domain preview - render a domain's home page under its own Host,
    server-side, so an operator can prepare/debug a new domain before DNS/TLS
    is live (domain-preview action).
  * SM155: first-class aliases - a host that serves the same content as an
    existing domain (clienta.com + www.clienta.com); domain_add_alias, a
    domain-alias-add action, a `lazysite-domains alias` CLI verb, grouped under
    the canonical in the list.
  * Domains add-form grouped (Identity/Presentation); theme field is a picker
    of installed themes.

